.cache
*.o

# Every host_test* binary the Makefile produces. Pattern, not a list: the
# enumerated version silently let three binaries (menu_model, screen_model,
# datetime_field) get committed as Mach-O executables in 2026-09-08 because
# nobody added them here when they landed. Same failure the CI job had -- it
# listed the binaries to run by hand and had been skipping four of them.
host_test
host_test_*
